#: ../../site/releases.md:3
msgid "What version you are reading"
msgstr "你正在读的版本"

#: ../../site/releases.md:5
msgid "The project tracks three version domains, and they are deliberately separate:"
msgstr "项目跟踪三个版本域，且它们刻意分开："

