#: ../../site/releases.md:13
msgid ""
"`fincore::version_string` is the native version constant. Note that "
"`fincore::version()` deliberately returns the **pinned Python** version, not"
" the native one — it exists so consumer metadata checks can compare against "
"the frozen oracle. If you want the library version at run time, read "
"`fincore::version_string`."
msgstr ""
"`fincore::version_string` 是原生版本常量。注意 `fincore::version()` 刻意返回**固定的 Python**"
" 版本，而不是原生版本 —— 它存在是为了让消费者元数据检查能对照冻结的 oracle。若要在运行时取库版本，请读 "
"`fincore::version_string`。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:19
msgid "Current status"
msgstr "当前状态"

#: ../../site/releases.md:21
msgid ""
"`0.1.0` is tagged **`v0.1.0`** on 2026-10-26, from the commit whose CI "
"passed on Windows, macOS and Ubuntu; the [GitHub "
"release](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp/releases/tag/v0.1.0) "
"carries the notes. `master` is the published branch, and every push to it "
"rebuilds the documentation site, so \"latest\" on the site and `master` are "
"the same tree."
msgstr ""
"`0.1.0` 已于 2026-10-26 打上 **`v0.1.0`** 标签，取自 CI 在 Windows、macOS 与 Ubuntu "
"上全部通过的提交；说明见 [GitHub "
"Release](https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp/releases/tag/v0.1.0)。`master`"
" 是发布分支，每次推送都会重建文档站点，因此站点上的“latest”与仓库 `master` 是同一棵树。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:28
msgid "What is stable enough to build on:"
msgstr "可以放心构建的部分："

#: ../../site/releases.md:30
msgid ""
"The public headers under `include/fincore`, documented symbol by symbol in "
"the API ledger."
msgstr "`include/fincore` 下的公共头文件，在 API 清单中逐符号记录。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:32
msgid "The CMake package contract (`fincore::fincore`, optional `implot` component)."
msgstr "CMake 包契约（`fincore::fincore`，可选 `implot` 组件）。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:33
msgid "The report document schema and the artifact bundle shape."
msgstr "报表文档模式与 artifact bundle 形状。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:34
msgid "Error categories and their structured fields."
msgstr "错误分类及其结构化字段。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:36
msgid ""
"What may still move without a deprecation cycle, because `0.x` makes no "
"compatibility promise:"
msgstr "仍可能在没有弃用周期的情况下变化的部分，因为 `0.x` 不承诺兼容："

#: ../../site/releases.md:39
msgid "Internal `fincore::detail` helpers, which are outside the public surface."
msgstr "内部的 `fincore::detail` 辅助函数，它们在公共接口之外。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:40
msgid "Optional extension and plotting adapters."
msgstr "可选的扩展与绘图适配器。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:41
msgid "Diagnostic field names inside `diagnostics` maps."
msgstr "`diagnostics` 映射里的诊断字段名。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:43
msgid "Change log for this cycle"
msgstr "本周期的变更记录"

#: ../../site/releases.md:45
msgid ""
"Recorded by area rather than by commit; the linked records carry the "
"evidence."
msgstr "按领域记录而不是按提交；链接的记录携带证据。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:47
msgid "**Library and correctness**"
msgstr "**库与正确性**"

#: ../../site/releases.md:49
msgid ""
"Native C++23 surface across core data, metrics, risk, portfolio, factor, "
"attribution, optimization, reporting, runtime and simulation modules."
msgstr "覆盖核心数据、指标、风险、组合、因子、归因、优化、报表、运行时与模拟模块的原生 C++23 接口。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:51
msgid "1092 C++ tests, including oracle comparisons and consumer build checks."
msgstr "1092 个 C++ 测试，包括 oracle 对比与消费者构建检查。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:52
msgid ""
"Documented failure model: structural problems throw, undefined statistics "
"return `NaN`, and fits report status instead of a plausible number."
msgstr "已记录的失败模型：结构性问题抛异常，无定义的统计量返回 `NaN`，拟合报告状态而不是一个看似合理的数字。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:55
msgid "**Documentation**"
msgstr "**文档**"

#: ../../site/releases.md:57
msgid ""
"One bilingual site (English and Simplified Chinese) with a language switch "
"on every page; the Chinese build is a full translation, not a stub."
msgstr "一套双语文档站点（英文与简体中文），每页都有语言切换；中文构建是完整翻译，不是占位。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:59
msgid ""
"Every public symbol documented; the few reviewed exemptions (three "
"`Subclassed by` lists, two multi-line string constants, functions without "
"`@param` lists) are recorded in the iteration-10 exemptions file rather than"
" hidden in the build."
msgstr ""
"每个公共符号都有说明；少数经审阅的豁免（三条 `Subclassed by` 列表、两个多行字符串常量、缺少 `@param` 的函数）记录在迭代 10"
" 的豁免文件里，而不是藏在构建中。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:63
msgid ""
"Tutorial, cookbook, task guides, migration mapping and troubleshooting built"
" from the same headers the reference is generated from."
msgstr "教程、配方集、任务指南、迁移映射与故障排查，都基于生成参考的同一批头文件。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:66
msgid "**Tooling and evidence**"
msgstr "**工具与证据**"

#: ../../site/releases.md:68
msgid "`check_comment_only.py` proves comment rounds change only comments."
msgstr "`check_comment_only.py` 证明注释轮只改了注释。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:69
msgid ""
"`check_built_site.py` checks both language builds for broken links, machine "
"paths and untranslated catalogs, and refuses to run when one build is "
"missing."
msgstr "`check_built_site.py` 检查两种语言构建的断链、机器路径与未翻译目录，并在缺少一种构建时拒绝运行。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:71
msgid "`write_sitemap.py` derives the sitemap from the deployed artefact."
msgstr "`write_sitemap.py` 从部署的产物推导 sitemap。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:72
msgid ""
"Paired benchmark harness with digest-gated correctness and recorded "
"INCONCLUSIVE outcomes."
msgstr "成对基准框架，正确性由摘要门控，并记录 INCONCLUSIVE 结果。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:75
msgid ""
"See [publication](publication.md) for what is live, and the iteration "
"records in `docs/iterations/` for dated acceptance evidence."
msgstr "线上状态见[发布说明](publication.md)，有日期的验收证据见 `docs/iterations/` 下的迭代记录。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:78
msgid "How the next release will be cut"
msgstr "下一个发布如何切出"

#: ../../site/releases.md:80
msgid ""
"Update `version.hpp` and `docs/site/conf.py` together, then run the full "
"gate (`ctest`, both strict Sphinx builds, the site checker)."
msgstr ""
"同时更新 `version.hpp` 与 `docs/site/conf.py`，然后运行完整门禁（`ctest`、两种严格 Sphinx "
"构建、站点检查器）。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:82
msgid "Tag `v<version>` on the commit that passed, and push the tag."
msgstr "在通过的那个提交上打 `v<version>` 标签并推送标签。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:83
msgid ""
"Confirm the documentation site rebuilt from the tag's tree, and record the "
"deployed URLs in the publication page."
msgstr "确认文档站点已从该标签的树重建，并把部署地址记录到发布页。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:85
msgid "Write the release notes from the iteration records, not from memory."
msgstr "依据迭代记录撰写发布说明，而不是凭记忆。"

#: ../../site/releases.md:87
msgid ""
"`v0.1.0` followed exactly this sequence; the tag points at the commit whose "
"`ci` run was green on all three platforms."
msgstr "`v0.1.0` 正是按这个顺序完成的；标签指向 `ci` 在三个平台全绿的那个提交。"

